{"articleNo":"104105","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=104105&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"생활관(푸름관)생 아침식사 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.21","hit":"4019","attachments":[{"name":"오름관 아침 식사 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=104105&attachNo=73205"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2014-1학기 생활관(푸름관)생 중 아침식사를 하기 원하는 학생은 </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">아래와 같이 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">1. 대상 : 2014-1학기 생활관(푸름관)생</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2. 식사기간 : 2014.4.1.(화) ~ 6.24(화), 85식</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">식사장소 :&nbsp;오름관 식당</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">3. 금액 : 229,500원 (2,700원*85식=229,500원)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">4. 신청기간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">2014. 3. 24(월) ~ 3.26(수)</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청장소 : 관리동 2층 행정실로 방문하여 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">5. 식대 납부기간 : </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">2014. 3.27(목) ~ 3.28(금)</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#ea0b0b\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">※ 오름관 식당은 주7일 의무식이며, 식대 환불은 되지 않습니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#ea0b0b\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"></span></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></font></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
